  "description": "Myeong-Ha’s beloved boyfriend Tae-On—her pride and everything—has died, leaving behind a will addressed to his friend Jeong-U: “I leave all my assets to my beloved girlfriend.” But there’s a twist—Tae-On had not one, but three girlfriends. Under Jeong-U’s supervision, a quiet yet intense battle unfolds. With 3 billion won at stake, only one can inherit it all. Who will emerge as the “beloved girlfriend,” and what truths will surface as each woman stakes her claim?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
